# Rust / Cargo
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
# Cargo.lock IS committed for the desktop crate: this produces a distributable
# binary, so dependency resolution must be reproducible across build machines
# (Sprint O / gap G6). Do not re-ignore it.

# Tauri generated
/gen/

# The repo-root .gitignore ignores `dist/`, but desktop/dist holds the Tauri
# frontendDist assets (loading + crash screens) that MUST be committed.
!dist/
!dist/**
